silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_03_construction_dag_concrete_anchor#typedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedClaim is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TypedClaim} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
