    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.03_construction_dag.concrete_anchor#pagesection" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_03_construction_dag_concrete_anchor#pagesection silm:hasLongDescription "The PageSection is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{PageSection} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
