silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_03_construction_dag_concrete_anchor#trace silm:hasLongDescription "The Trace is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{Trace} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
