silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_03_construction_dag_concrete_anchor#musicnode_10 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_10 is the ChunkManifest profiling the music-entry task — a Yoneda-profile reader for incoming and outgoing arrows of the engine apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_10}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
