silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_03_construction_dag_concrete_anchor#musicnode_11 silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicNode_11 is the SourceWitness from the cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md JoC §11 colimit citation, an external authority source leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'concept{MusicNode_11}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
